# Notes on the FX track ("note ping"): the resonance sits on A2, E3, A3, C5 and each note sweeps it down from above.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track fx1
input noise 0.3
param p1 128
param p2 95
param pan 128
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 A2 6
note 8 E3 6
note 16 A3 3
note 20 A3 3
note 24 C5 8
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
